{"id":"n17749-1-7","stage":1,"title":"계시다 · 在、待（있다 的尊敬语）","scene":"询问在韩国居住的时间","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17749-1-7-1","ko":"한국에는 얼마나 계셨습니까?","zh":"您在韩国待了多久呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한국에는","meaning":"韩国","explanation":"한국：韩国；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"한국에는","audio":"/audio/30644c778f5498b19f11.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한국에는","audio":"/audio/30644c778f5498b19f11.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多久","explanation":"얼마나：询问持续的时间或程度；这里是“多久”。","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"계셨습니까?","meaning":"待了、住了（尊敬语）","explanation":"계시다 是 있다 的主语尊敬语；계셨습니까? 是过去时的正式礼貌问句，询问在韩国待了多久。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17749","senseId":"1","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계셨습니까","audio":"/audio/c3034035aaf0a109340a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多久、多少","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"询问时间长短、数量或程度；这里问在韩国待了多久。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"e0bef9809d26f11e","term":"계시다","zh":"在、待（尊敬语）","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3","entryId":"17749","definition":"있다 的主语尊敬形式；本句询问对方在韩国待过多久。","pronunciation":["계ː시다","게ː시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a82447653a81e3a00a16.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17749-1-7-2","ko":"벌써 한국에서 산 지도 삼 년이 되었네요.","zh":"转眼我在韩国已经住了三年了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经、转眼","explanation":"벌써：已经，比预想或感觉更早；这里带有“转眼就”的语气。","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"한국에서","meaning":"韩国","explanation":"한국：韩国；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"한국에서","audio":"/audio/b0c6c90af98c253c3d0d.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한국에서","audio":"/audio/b0c6c90af98c253c3d0d.mp3"}},{"text":"산","meaning":"住了的","explanation":"산：살다“住”的过去定语形，后接 지 表示“自从住在韩国以来”。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}},{"text":"지도","meaning":"以来（-ㄴ 지）","explanation":"-ㄴ 지 表示从动作发生到现在的时间；도 加强“都已经”的语气，산 지도 是“自住在这里以来”。","readings":[{"term":"지","audio":"/audio/32e608b594bece7ab3a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91881","senseId":"1","lemma":"지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지도","audio":"/audio/82c5fe62d75b8c38b810.mp3"}},{"text":"삼","meaning":"三","explanation":"삼：三。","readings":[{"term":"삼","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61854","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삼","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3"}},{"text":"년이","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"년이","audio":"/audio/c66de169640c62288efd.mp3"}},{"text":"되었네요.","meaning":"到了、已有","explanation":"되다：时间达到三年；-었- 表示已发生，-네요 带发现或感叹语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되었네요","audio":"/audio/eb3506475aa9235d5cab.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"32e608b594bece7a","term":"지","zh":"以来","audio":"/audio/32e608b594bece7ab3a3.mp3","entryId":"91881","definition":"接动词过去定语形，表示自某事发生以来经过的时间。","pronunciation":["지"]},{"id":"3cd6c40aac5fd42e","term":"삼","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3","entryId":"61854","definition":"二加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["삼"]},{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"达到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"时间达到一定长度；本句指在韩国居住已达三年。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e229b823844c1b196315.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.518,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17749","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":38,"sequenceScore":1.6677,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["转眼我在韩国已经住了三年了。","您在韩国待了多久呢？","我需要在什么时候之前完成工作？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您在韩国待了多久呢？","我需要在什么时候之前完成工作？","转眼我在韩国已经住了三年了。"],"answer":2}]}
